<name>SINS OF OUR FATHERS — surveillance and security geometry overlay rev1</name>
<description>Overlay derived from owner KML mission map (5).kml. Apply on top of the 2026-08-07 rev2 base map. Contains the surveillance/security and closely associated geometry added or revised after mission map (2).kml. Where a semantic feature conflicts, this overlay controls. The rooftop enforcement UAV dock supersedes the earlier rooftop UAV dock label, and the current western poolside bungalow marker supersedes the earlier base position. Production remains subject to the locked east-west fictionalization mirror.</description>
<Placemark><name>western poolside bungalow</name><Point><coordinates>-64.82419893794359,18.30251229882312,19.35543425675987</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
