<Placemark><name>MARS riot suppression robot dock</name><description>This robot is also inactive unless the player uses explosives or similar heavier munitions inside the holding facility area. Tripper can also sabotage the docking port to cause the robot to malfuction when docked into it.</description><Point><coordinates>-64.82479297949175,18.30167169613804,11.03744910161298</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
