<Placemark><name>autonomous quadrupedal "robot dog" enforcement UGV</name><description>Quadrupedal canine-like autonomous enforcement robot, equipped with a top mounted .50 cal rifle module. Inactive unless attacked by the player or when the player is recognized as a serious-enough threat through the CCTV security cameras inside the main residence and the courtyard and the other buildings in it. Can be sabotaged the same way other robots can.</description><Point><coordinates>-64.8241344723771,18.30248108496329,18.30119133363553</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
